      "kind" : "edit.markdownNote",
      "parameters" : {
        "text" : "# Ashen Path · 3D camera\nRun the workflow, then click a revealed stone tile in the Trackpad to walk there. The perspective camera follows the adventurer. Edit the Camera yaw \/ pitch JSON node to change the angle: yawDegrees orbits around the player (0–360), and pitchDegrees raises the camera (20–80). Stop and start Run after editing an angle; GPU Program parameters restart the game state. Collect seven coins across the four raised planes. Approach the horned creature and click Action on the Trackpad, or press Space, to swing your sword. Three hits defeat it. Collect every coin and defeat the creature to light the central portal. This copy keeps its 3D scene and game logic in AshenPath3DProgram.metal; the original isometric example remains separate."
      },
